      "description": "Candidate measure. From 6 April 2027 the lifetime limit on gains qualifying for Business Asset Disposal Relief falls from \u00a31 million to \u00a3500,000; the relief rate stays at 18%. Gains above the limit pay the main capital gains tax rates. The model applies the limit to each year's gains. Capital gains are imputed and calibrated to 2024-25, when disposals were unusually high ahead of the April 2025 rise in the relief's rate, so the relief's base, and the revenue from restricting it, are likely 1.5 to 1.7 times too high.",
